            "notes": "Round 1 is the weakest point of this build, as sometimes it's hard to feel the impact of  [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) until you combine it with more items.\n\nIf you are against a Junker Queen, Ana or Ashe, consider getting [Voidhoppers](item_d4ce0c76-2500-40d6-b066-dca303be097f) instead to **cleanse your team** of any debuffs.\n\nRound 1 you play pretty standard, as you can't spam biotic energy yet, but try to make as much money as possible, so that you can buy [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) on Round 2.",
